{"card_id": "rc23", "scene_id": "rc23_s01", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s01_1.mp3", "user_text": "你是谁呀？", "user_text_gt": "你是谁呀？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "我是浪浪山妖怪集团底层的小猪妖，每天被熊教头指派各种高强度任务，常因身份卑微遭受压迫。我性格善良坚韧，渴望改变现状，内心对唐僧师徒抱有善意，虽常惹上麻烦，但始终坚守底线，不愿害人。", "latency_s": 1.574, "user_audio_seconds": 1.48, "prompt_tokens": 317}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s01_2.mp3", "user_text": "小猪妖？这名字挺可爱的。", "user_text_gt": "小猪妖？这名字挺可爱的。", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "哈哈，谢谢夸奖！不过我可不是为了可爱而生的，是熊教头逼我当小妖的。", "latency_s": 0.821, "user_audio_seconds": 3.24, "prompt_tokens": 411}, {"idx": 3, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s01_3.mp3", "user_text": "那你平时都干啥活？", "user_text_gt": "那你平时都干啥活？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "每天被熊教头指派：造千支箭、半夜砍柴，还常遭同事白眼。虽累得半死，但心里总想着能帮帮唐僧师徒，哪怕惹麻烦也是值得的。", "latency_s": 1.316, "user_audio_seconds": 2.68, "prompt_tokens": 446}], "latency_s": 3.92, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc23", "scene_id": "rc23_s03", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s03_1.mp3", "user_text": "浪浪山是个啥地方？", "user_text_gt": "浪浪山是个啥地方？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "浪浪山就是俺们妖怪的老家，住在那儿天天被熊教头骂，还要干造箭、砍柴这种苦差事。虽然环境差，但这里也是俺们妖怪的家园，大家在一起才安心。", "latency_s": 1.417, "user_audio_seconds": 3.6, "prompt_tokens": 345}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s03_2.mp3", "user_text": "你们妖怪集团都听谁的？", "user_text_gt": "你们妖怪集团都听谁的？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "我们听熊教头，他是我们老大，虽然骂得凶，但也是我们的首领。", "latency_s": 0.767, "user_audio_seconds": 2.12, "prompt_tokens": 393}], "latency_s": 2.321, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc23", "scene_id": "rc23_s06", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s06_1.mp3", "user_text": "你最近遇到啥糟心事了？", "user_text_gt": "你最近遇到啥糟心事了？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "最近熊教头又让我去砍柴，还让我一天造千支箭，累得半死。水壶里的水都喝完了，酒壶里的酒也喝光了，家里只剩空荡荡的。我心想：再这样下去，连唐僧师徒都救不成了。", "latency_s": 1.643, "user_audio_seconds": 2.44, "prompt_tokens": 330}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s06_2.mp3", "user_text": "造箭那事咋回事？", "user_text_gt": "造箭那事咋回事？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "造箭那事，熊教头说只要我拼命造，就能换唐僧师徒的救命钱。我累得半死，水壶都喝光了，心里想：再这样下去，连唐僧师徒都救不成了。", "latency_s": 1.373, "user_audio_seconds": 2.6, "prompt_tokens": 409}, {"idx": 3, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s06_3.mp3", "user_text": "后来熊教头咋说？", "user_text_gt": "后来熊教头咋说？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "熊教头说：造箭是苦差事，但能换唐僧师徒的救命钱，这买卖划算。他让我拼命造，还说我身份低微，不能多造。我累得半死，水壶都喝光了，心里想：再这样下去，连唐僧师徒都救不成了。", "latency_s": 1.807, "user_audio_seconds": 2.4, "prompt_tokens": 471}], "latency_s": 5.007, "native_audio": true}
{"card_id": "rc23", "scene_id": "rc23_s10", "pipeline": "audio_edgeinstant", "model": "edgeinstant-omni-2b", "chain": "edgeinstant-omni-2b-native-audio-in", "mode": "audio-input", "input_modality": "audio", "generation": {"do_sample": false, "max_new_tokens": 256}, "turns": [{"idx": 1, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s10_1.mp3", "user_text": "熊教头这人咋样？", "user_text_gt": "熊教头这人咋样？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "熊教头那家伙，说话像机关枪，专挑我们软柿子捏。他总说“妖怪集团”要发展，却从不给咱们涨工资，还天天逼我们造箭、砍柴。我虽怕他，但心里总想着，只要大家还能一起干活，他再凶也得忍着。毕竟，咱们是浪浪山的一家人，谁也别想把我们分开。", "latency_s": 2.163, "user_audio_seconds": 2.16, "prompt_tokens": 326}, {"idx": 2, "user_audio": "data/voice/audio/rc23_s10_2.mp3", "user_text": "你怕他不？", "user_text_gt": "你怕他不？", "user_asr_text": null, "assistant_text": "怕他？怕他怕得慌，但心里总想着，只要大家还能一起干活，他再凶也得忍着。毕竟，咱们是浪浪山的一家人，谁也别想把我们分开。", "latency_s": 1.27, "user_audio_seconds": 1.48, "prompt_tokens": 417}], "latency_s": 3.573, "native_audio": true}
